                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Arthavi is a premium, privacy-focused fintech application for Indian investors. It serves as a comprehensive dashboard that aggregates Mutual Funds (via CAS imports) and Stocks to show your true net worth and XIRR without requiring you to link your demat accounts."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Is Arthavi free?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes, it is free for now. Arthavi offers core portfolio tracking features free of cost because we believe in accessible financial clarity for all Indian investors."
