                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Arthavi does not sell, share, or use user data for marketing or lead generation, period. We do not sell data to third parties or share it with brokers. There is no cold-call monetization model, and we don't even collect phone numbers—it's not mandatory for signup, so there is no risk of marketing calls from our end. Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and we only ask for minimal permissions required to show your portfolio insights."
