            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Do you support fixed or debt instruments like FDs, PPF, and NPS?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "100% agree—a portfolio tracker isn't complete without debt instruments. They are on our roadmap! Our vision is to track everything in one place, not just equity. Right now, equity and mutual funds are the focus, but support for fixed income instruments like FDs, PPF, and NPS is definitely coming soon."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "How does the Ask AI Investment Assistant work?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "The Ask AI feature acts as your personal financial analyst. You can ask it plain-English questions about your portfolio, such as 'Am I over-invested in banking?' or 'What is my XIRR?'. It instantly analyzes your imported CAS and stock data to give you clear, objective insights."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Is the AI Assistant giving me financial advice?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "No, the AI Assistant provides data-driven analytics and insights based purely on the portfolio data you upload. It is not designed to give certified financial advice or recommend specific stocks/funds to buy or sell. It simply helps you understand your investments better based on data."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Does the AI have access to my sensitive login credentials?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Not at all. The AI only analyzes the abstract portfolio data (transactions and holdings) that you upload via CAS. We do not link to your demat accounts and we never ask for broker login credentials. The AI's analysis is done in a secure, privacy-first environment."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can I track family portfolios or multiple CAS files?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes, you can upload multiple CAS files to consolidate and track investments across different family members. Arthavi aggregates this data to give you a unified view of your entire family's net worth and combined portfolio performance."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Is Arthavi better than tracking investments in Excel?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Absolutely. While Excel requires manual data entry, complex formulas, and constant updates for live prices, Arthavi automates this entire process. We calculate your XIRR, analyze sector overlap, and pull live market data automatically."
